id-at-qlaDomainList OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 7914 1 4 1 2 }
id-at-qlaUidPrefix OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 7914 1 4 1 3 }
