id-at-qlaMailMStorePrefix OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 7914 1 4 1 6 }
id-at-qlaMailQuotaSize OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 7914 1 4 1 7 }
id-at-qlaMailQuotaCount OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 7914 1 4 1 8 }
